[{"client_msg_id":"8096c957-ed79-4526-bc19-36cf30222477","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"あと、プラグインの設定が別のプラグインに入っちゃうやつは、packerだと↓みたいな関数用意してそれで存在確認して分岐してますね\n```vim.api.nvim_exec([[\nfunction! IsPluginInstalled(name) abort\n  return luaeval(\"_G.packer_plugins['\" .. a:name .. \"'] ~= nil\")\nendfunction\n]], true)```\nこういうやつ\n\u003chttps://github.com/yutkat/dotfiles/blob/52db06ac638df87e34ebd7ac323653a328a982ca/.config/nvim/rc/pluginconfig/nvim-hlslens.vim\u003e","ts":"1620281090.336700","edited":{"user":"U7B4ZD49X","ts":"1620281127.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UGN0T63GC"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YM0va"}]},{"client_msg_id":"13284d53-2087-4297-b6e3-cf44b16b7b13","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"私こんな感じにしてますね。各プラグインの方でprefix定義しててそれをwhich-keyの方でmapしてます\n\u003chttps://github.com/yutkat/dotfiles/blob/master/.config/nvim/lua/rc/pluginconfig/which-key.lua\u003e","ts":"1620280364.334900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UGN0T63GC"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7F28"}]},{"client_msg_id":"39ec3395-78e9-40f3-a73e-174dc29547ca","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"\u003c@U7B4ZD49X\u003e 参考までに聞きたいんですが、which-key の設定とキーマップの定義は一緒にやってます?  自分は 各 pulgin の設定をできるだけ独立させたいんで、キーマップの定義は各plugin の設定のところで定義し、which-key の方では label だけ設定するようにしてます(が、キー2回書かないといけないのでめんどい)","ts":"1620280097.333900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GqoU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"959e5bfd-5a62-4f70-aaef-fc1916fac1fd","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"私はデフォルトででるの気に入らなかったんで全部オフにしましたね。（キーマップいじりまくり勢だから）","ts":"1620279817.330200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6xrwJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8628130b-1a51-4f70-aa0b-34a472970509","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"ですね。plugin でマッピングの定義が長いやつだけ明示的に設定してやると、それなりに使えると思います。","ts":"1620279810.330000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=rZ9C"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43e52565-96b0-4944-adce-4d0881102ef1","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"とりあえずぶちこむ、でなくて気になったらカスタムする、で良さそう","ts":"1620279654.327100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KStj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5f0bd58f-4496-49fe-b094-2c246b07de83","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"ふんふんなるほど、コンテキストの狭いやつを拾いそびれるからこちらから教えてあげる感じですな","ts":"1620279639.327000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oSP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"93193f6a-c6a5-45c6-9430-020830c39933","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"一応、全く設定なしでも `:map` から自動的にメニューを作成してくれます。textobj や operator も組み込みのものはデフォルトの preset で定義されているので、ある程度は使えます。まあ、読みにくいですけど。","ts":"1620279578.326900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Iea"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d68c89d4-99ce-4225-99b7-485d85f8c94f","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"なるほど、設定確かに大変そうですね","ts":"1620279432.324700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Mtjyu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f0a8f68e-4d14-44e8-9401-dec63ba85f06","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"おおー","ts":"1620279272.324600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oq19K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7eb19986-56a9-43df-b6da-d2c467ec2555","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"vim-which-key と比べて、かゆい所に手が届く感じでいいですね。","ts":"1620279143.323800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ACIT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8eaa9abd-741a-41ed-92f2-a91909999d5a","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"私も乗り換えましたねー設定に手間取ったけど概ね便利","ts":"1620279059.322600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HwXGZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b385a720-36d1-432a-abb3-2e2d1f839e41","type":"message","user":"UGN0T63GC","text":"which-key.nvim 試してみる。register や textobj も表示してくれるし、buffer ローカルなマッピングも表示できるしで、本家 (vim-which-key) より高機能だった。\n\n\u003chttps://github.com/folke/which-key.nvim\u003e","ts":"1620278986.321700","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: folke/which-key.nvim","id":1,"title":"folke/which-key.nvim","title_link":"https://github.com/folke/which-key.nvim","text":":boom: Create key bindings that stick. WhichKey is a lua plugin for Neovim 0.5 that displays a popup with possible keybindings of the command you started typing. - folke/which-key.nvim","image_url":"https://repository-images.githubusercontent.com/362423752/28ef3400-a805-11eb-90a1-572baa95ca30","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/folke/which-key.nvim","original_url":"https://github.com/folke/which-key.nvim"}],"edited":{"user":"UGN0T63GC","ts":"1620278997.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"S6T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4cfdc4e0-0d29-4057-878f-98f8f7139ffe","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"どういうムーブだ","ts":"1620277566.319200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B+r"}]},{"client_msg_id":"13eaefe4-4c9e-4f0a-823e-51dc225b4bef","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"今気がついたけど、これニセkuuさんだ。またアイコン変わってる","ts":"1620277473.319100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":